# Goal
# The goal picks its type. Regular wave: height and period, positions left empty.
# Wave height H in meters and wave period in seconds.
float64 height
float64 period
# Absolute wavemaker positions in meters, sampled at this fixed interval.
# Pregenerated: positions and sample_interval, height and period left at 0.
float64[] positions
float64 sample_interval
---
# Result
bool success
string message
---
# Feedback
float64 desired_position
float64 actual_position
float64 elapsed_time
